## Code Example
```javascript
function sampleTenant(tenantId, weight) {
  // Simple 32-bit hash derived seed
  const seed = hash32(tenantId);
  const r = (seed * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;
  return (r / 4294967296) < weight;
}
```

